Description: Orbit's base: what every Orbit machine has, with a screen or without
 The firewall (orbit-firewall), the services and their helper
 (orbit-services) and orbitctl, whose `orbitctl services` turns them on
 and off from a terminal. Alone, it makes a server without a graphical
 session; orbit-desktop pulls it for the desktop.
Depends: orbit-firewall, orbit-services, orbitctl
